YaeMarine Marine VHF Antenna Mount, Ratchet Mount, Heavy Duty Adjustable Base Marine Antenna Mount for Boat, yacht, 316 Stainless Steel Marine Antenna Mount made of 316 stainless steel, Heavy duty construction for tough conditions; Dual swiveling ratchet design, The marine VHF antenna mounts have two adjustable ratchets, The upper ratchet has an adjustable angle of 270 degrees and the lower ratchet has an adjustable angle of 180 degrees, Easy to adapt to deck or side installation on inclined or horizontal surfaces; Used for boat, yacht, ship wires mounting, Fits all standard 1" marine antennas, Base measures 3.66x 2.52inch;  Standard marine antenna thread can be inserted directly, easy to install and convenient to use, Mount with 1/4" FH fasteners (not included); Package Included:  1 x Heavy duty Marine VHF Antenna Mount;

