This Rugs barstool comes with a full back support with a modern style, it is made with PU and a chrome base. The stool can also be moved and adjusted in height and has a foot support for comfort, It has a stylish and modern feel with a comfortable seating position. It can be used in the kitchen with your breakfast bar, in the lounge and would suit any room décor.Features:Made from PU Seating and metal baseCome with gas rod for easy height adjustmentThick sponge is filled into seatArmrest and backrest supportProtective anti-slip ring on the bottom of baseMetal base is chrome platedProduct Features:* Beautiful designed leather style Rugs a modern feeling to any beauty or hair salon;* Come on a rotating chrome disc base with hydraulic height lift;* Soft and comfortable cushion pad which can be removed for cleaning when necessary;* An easily accessible lever to adjust the height of the Rugs from the sitting position;* 360 Degree swivel;

